WEBVTT

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.216
or bike ride,

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.326
people should be able to live

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:37.706
the essence of what constitutes
the urban experience:

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.266
to access work,

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.496
housing,

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:45.246
food, health, education,

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.423
culture and leisure.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.996
Have you ever stopped to ask yourself:

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:58.846
Why does a noisy and polluted street
need to be a noisy and polluted street?

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:00.429
Just because it is?